text:
This looks like a leftover tray. The remaining food is minimal: a cup of coffee with milk, and a small plate holding empty muffin wrappers and jam and butter packets. The large plate has only crumbs and traces of egg. There are two small tubs with traces of butter, and the glass has a little liquid.

The food that is still there is mostly the coffee with milk, at about 200 g and 30 kcal. Crumbs and egg residue add roughly 10 g and 25 kcal. Butter residue is about 3 g and 20 kcal. Leftovers in the muffin wrappers add about 3 g and 10 kcal. The total comes to roughly 216 g and 85 kcal, so I rounded to 215 g.

